de prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, Aug-Sep ran 161% of normal and Jan-Feb ran 62%. So far in 2026, Apr-May came in at 73% and May to June at 72%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 31034 got 35% of normal that year.</p>"}
